WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.964
- She laughed at me.

00:00:00.964 --> 00:00:01.797
- Shame.

00:00:01.797 --> 00:00:02.630
- Numb.

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:03.496
- Humiliation.

00:00:03.496 --> 00:00:06.002
- I didn't tell anyone for six years.

00:00:06.002 --> 00:00:06.907
- Guilty.

00:00:06.907 --> 00:00:07.740
- Denial.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:08.884
